  "description": "In a world where alphas and omegas are the stuff of urban legends, Do-Ha is a rare dominant omega who usually deals with his heat cycle through casual one-night stands. One day, he uses a matching service and gets paired up with an alpha named Ji-Hwan. Things get unexpectedly intense. Overwhelmed by pheromones, Do-Ha forgets about precautions and ends up knotted, leaving him in shock. However, Ji-Hwan seems entirely unfazed by the situation and boldly suggests they meet again, saying, \"Don't tell me you're scared because I'm an alpha...\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
